window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v26-041-a26095898893f24f.json"]={sha256:"a26095898893f24f91daae9ec2e955314b4e3fe25ae4d52f8f2bba48c5069ea6",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v26-case-8646d75e80f37cf7","url":"https://hpc.llnl.gov/documentation/tutorials/introduction-parallel-computing-tutorial","title":"Introduction to Parallel Computing: performance analysis","titleEn":"Introduction to Parallel Computing: performance analysis","publisher":"Lawrence Livermore National Laboratory","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v26-041","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v26-041","related":[{"id":"hpc-v26-042","referenceUrls":["https://hpc.llnl.gov/documentation/tutorials/introduction-parallel-computing-tutorial"],"title":"弱擴展：每工作者問題量與總成本","titleEn":"Weak scaling: per-worker work and aggregate cost","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付強擴展曲線、相同工作清單與資源成本比較；兩效率可重算且問題固定，報告保留速度、效率與資源時間不同單位；請另一位學徒依交付件重新推導一組；未通過或資料不足必須明記，不以品牌或峰值取代證據。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver strong-scaling curves, equal-work manifests, and resource comparisons. Reproduce both efficiencies with fixed work. Distinguish speedup, efficiency, and resource-time units. Have another learner derive one case from the handover; label failures or missing evidence without substituting brand names or peak rates.","difference":"列P1/16/64各總格數1/16/64百萬，每格物理工作與迭代數不變；.8333/.625正確，局部工作不變且總量隨P成長。","differenceEn":"List 1, 16, and 64 million total cells with fixed per-cell work, resolution conventions, and iteration counts. Verify both efficiencies, constant local work, and total work growing with P.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["S(P)=T1/TP，E=S/P；必須同一問題、正確性與計時邊界；合成T1=120秒，P4時TP36秒，P8時TP22秒；名義式 120/36/4 = 0.833333333333 parallel efficiency；變更式 120/22/8 = 0.681818181818 parallel efficiency。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","Eweak=Tbaseline/Tscaled，在每工作者工作相同的條件下；總工作與P同比成長；合成每工作者一百萬格，P1時間10秒，P16為12秒、P64為16秒；名義式 10/12 = 0.833333333333 weak-scaling efficiency；變更式 10/16 = 0.625 weak-scaling efficiency。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["S(P) = T1/TP and E = S/P require the same problem, correctness criterion, and timing boundaries. Synthetic T1 = 120 seconds, TP = 36 at P = 4, and TP = 22 at P = 8. Nominal 120/36/4 = 0.833333333333 parallel efficiency; changed 120/22/8 = 0.681818181818 parallel efficiency. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Weak efficiency is baseline time divided by scaled time, with constant work per worker and total work proportional to P. Synthetic one million cells per worker: P = 1 takes 10 seconds, P = 16 takes 12, and P = 64 takes 16. Nominal 10/12 = 0.833333333333 weak-scaling efficiency; changed 10/16 = 0.625 weak-scaling efficiency. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v26-051","referenceUrls":["https://www.mpi-forum.org/docs/mpi-4.1/mpi41-report.pdf"],"title":"MPI 網格分解：四面 halo 的通訊帳本","titleEn":"MPI domain decomposition: four-face halo accounting","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付強擴展曲線、相同工作清單與資源成本比較；兩效率可重算且問題固定，報告保留速度、效率與資源時間不同單位；請另一位學徒依交付件重新推導一組；未通過或資料不足必須明記，不以品牌或峰值取代證據。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver strong-scaling curves, equal-work manifests, and resource comparisons. Reproduce both efficiencies with fixed work. Distinguish speedup, efficiency, and resource-time units. Have another learner derive one case from the handover; label failures or missing evidence without substituting brand names or peak rates.","difference":"以合成資料重建「MPI 網格分解：四面 halo 的通訊帳本」，能分離架構事實、模型假設與驗收證據。完成：交付 rank 網格、四面索引、兩種分解的流量與殘差比對表。","differenceEn":"Reconstruct MPI domain decomposition: four-face halo accounting with synthetic data; distinguish architecture facts, model assumptions and acceptance evidence. Complete: Deliver rank maps, four-face indices, traffic budgets for both decompositions and residual comparisons.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["S(P)=T1/TP，E=S/P；必須同一問題、正確性與計時邊界；合成T1=120秒，P4時TP36秒，P8時TP22秒；名義式 120/36/4 = 0.833333333333 parallel efficiency；變更式 120/22/8 = 0.681818181818 parallel efficiency。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","由全域尺寸推出 n=512，分別計算每面和四面 bytes，再列出同大小接收量。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["S(P) = T1/TP and E = S/P require the same problem, correctness criterion, and timing boundaries. Synthetic T1 = 120 seconds, TP = 36 at P = 4, and TP = 22 at P = 8. Nominal 120/36/4 = 0.833333333333 parallel efficiency; changed 120/22/8 = 0.681818181818 parallel efficiency. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Derive n=512; calculate one-face and four-face bytes, then record equally sized receives.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v26-case-8646d75e80f37cf7","url":"https://hpc.llnl.gov/documentation/tutorials/introduction-parallel-computing-tutorial","title":"Parallel computing: scalability and performance","titleEn":"Parallel computing: scalability and performance","publisher":"Lawrence Livermore National Laboratory","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v26-case-245d4116a6090a19","url":"https://www.mpi-forum.org/docs/mpi-4.1/mpi41-report.pdf","title":"MPI 4.1 standard","titleEn":"MPI 4.1 standard","publisher":"MPI Forum","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
